<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1932498624"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1614556888"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Limit-tension"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="SennaRin"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Dignified"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:57.700"><div begin="00:08.392" end="02:57.820"><p begin="00:08.392" end="00:10.118" itunes:key="L1">喉に張り付く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">旋涡般的话语 紧紧攀附在喉咙处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no do ni ha ri tsu ku ko to no ha no u zu</span></p><p begin="00:10.250" end="00:11.962" itunes:key="L2">言の葉の渦</p><p begin="00:12.233" end="00:13.677" itunes:key="L3">すり減る前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能在内心消磨前 放手一切吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ri he ru ma e ni te ba na shi te i i ?</span></p><p begin="00:13.949" end="00:15.985" itunes:key="L4">手放していい？<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ri he ru ma e ni te ba na shi te i i ?</span></p><p begin="00:16.221" end="00:17.944" itunes:key="L5">不思議なまま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切仍旧不可思议</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu shi gi na ma ma</span></p><p begin="00:18.072" end="00:19.898" itunes:key="L6">繰り返す呼吸で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿在这不断重复的呼吸中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri ka e su ko kyu u de</span></p><p begin="00:20.134" end="00:21.774" itunes:key="L7">確かめたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细确认</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta shi ka me ta i</span></p><p begin="00:21.892" end="00:24.090" itunes:key="L8">この騒めき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中的骚动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no za wa me ki</span></p><p begin="00:24.325" end="00:27.963" itunes:key="L9">目覚めて仰ぐ空も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">醒来后 仰望的天空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me za me te a o gu so ra mo</span></p><p begin="00:28.353" end="00:31.837" itunes:key="L10">何かが違う気がした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎与以往有所不同</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni ka ga chi ga u ki ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="00:31.865" end="00:35.489" itunes:key="L11">戸惑い痛みも感じないうちに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">趁着还未感受到迷茫的痛楚前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ma do i i ta mi mo ka n ji na i u chi ni</span></p><p begin="00:35.564" end="00:38.440" itunes:key="L12">儚い一瞬を刻めば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将这虚幻的一瞬烙印心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ka na i i 's shu n wo ki za me ba</span></p><p begin="00:39.259" end="00:41.138" itunes:key="L13">Limit-tention<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧张至极了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Limit- tension</span></p><p begin="00:41.260" end="00:47.134" itunes:key="L14">2つ数えた 君の声と遅れて来た衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数过两声后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta tsu ka zo e ta</span></p><p begin="00:47.166" end="00:48.042" itunes:key="L36">今なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra</span></p><p begin="00:48.245" end="00:49.621" itunes:key="L15">そう素敵な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就向着美好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u su te ki na</span></p><p begin="00:49.632" end="00:51.804" itunes:key="L16">So so素敵な方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好的方向走去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So so su te ki na ho u he</span></p><p begin="00:52.037" end="00:55.092" itunes:key="L37">そう気付けば色付いていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到这一切后 眼前的视界便会点点染上色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ki du ke ba i ro du i te i ku</span></p><p begin="00:55.163" end="00:57.464" itunes:key="L38">走る稲妻の様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似一闪而过的闪电一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha shi ru i na zu ma no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:57.567" end="00:58.872" itunes:key="L17">閃けば<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闪烁出自己的光芒</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ra me ke ba</span></p><p begin="00:59.093" end="01:01.351" itunes:key="L39">くだらない感情なんか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无聊乏味的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku da ra na i ka n jo u na n ka</span></p><p begin="01:01.487" end="01:03.753" itunes:key="L40">役に立たない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本起不了任何作用</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku ni ta ta na i</span></p><p begin="01:03.824" end="01:05.668" itunes:key="L41">このままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="01:05.832" end="01:07.719" itunes:key="L18">そのままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如此时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="01:07.823" end="01:11.646" itunes:key="L42">瞬間が永遠になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">瞬间化作了永远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shu n ka n ga to wa ni na ru</span></p><p begin="01:11.707" end="01:13.622" itunes:key="L19">下手な覚悟が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">作出的笨拙觉悟 尽显徒劳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he ta na ka ku go ga ka ra ma wa ri su ru</span></p><p begin="01:13.744" end="01:15.638" itunes:key="L20">空回りする</p><p begin="01:15.748" end="01:17.431" itunes:key="L21">見つかる前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能在被人发现前 放手一切吗?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu ka ru ma e ni te ba na shi te i i ?</span></p><p begin="01:17.460" end="01:19.558" itunes:key="L22">手放して良い？</p><p begin="01:19.626" end="01:21.444" itunes:key="L23">妙な定めに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管鲁莽地为奇妙的命运呐喊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">myo u na sa da me ni ga mu sha ra ni sa ke n de mo</span></p><p begin="01:21.573" end="01:23.488" itunes:key="L24">我武者羅に叫んでも</p><p begin="01:23.620" end="01:25.225" itunes:key="L25">狂わされる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也只会让自己陷入癫狂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru wa sa re ru ka ra ku ri de su</span></p><p begin="01:25.382" end="01:27.519" itunes:key="L26">絡繰りです</p><p begin="01:27.823" end="01:31.464" itunes:key="L27">目醒めてしまえばすぐに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">苏醒后 便马上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me sa me te shi ma e ba su gu ni</span></p><p begin="01:31.882" end="01:35.373" itunes:key="L28">証明したい思いに眩む<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被渴望证明的心意冲击着思绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u me i shi ta i o mo i ni ku ra mu</span></p><p begin="01:35.413" end="01:39.054" itunes:key="L29">躊躇い迷いを感じる前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在感到踌躇 渺茫前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra i ma yo i wo ka n ji ru ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:39.107" end="01:42.699" itunes:key="L30">ほら耳を澄ましたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细侧耳倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra mi mi wo su ma shi ta ra</span></p><p begin="01:42.767" end="01:44.542" itunes:key="L31">Limit-tention<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧张至极了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Limit- tension</span></p><p begin="01:44.692" end="01:46.411" itunes:key="L32">2つ数えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数过两声后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta tsu ka zo e ta</span></p><p begin="01:46.421" end="01:50.563" itunes:key="L43">君の声と遅れて来た衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的冲动与你的声音一同 姗姗来迟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko e to o ku re te ki ta sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="01:50.578" end="01:51.528" itunes:key="L44">今なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra</span></p><p begin="01:51.639" end="01:53.061" itunes:key="L33">そう素敵な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就向着美好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u su te ki na</span></p><p begin="01:53.176" end="01:55.298" itunes:key="L34">So so素敵な方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好的方向走去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So so su te ki na ho u he</span></p><p begin="01:55.545" end="01:58.650" itunes:key="L45">そう気付けば色付いていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到这一切后 眼前的视界便会点点染上色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ki du ke ba i ro du i te i ku</span></p><p begin="01:58.653" end="02:00.983" itunes:key="L46">急かす街の理想を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越仓促定下的理想后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka su ma chi no ri so u wo ko e re ba mo u</span></p><p begin="02:01.119" end="02:02.452" itunes:key="L47">超えればもう<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ju n da ra ke no ko ta e ha</span></p><p begin="02:02.538" end="02:04.825" itunes:key="L48">矛盾だらけの応えは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就不断添附上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ju n da ra ke no ko ta e ha</span></p><p begin="02:05.125" end="02:07.140" itunes:key="L49">寄り添いあっていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽显矛盾的回应就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ri so i a 't te i i</span></p><p begin="02:07.290" end="02:09.195" itunes:key="L50">このままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="02:09.341" end="02:11.139" itunes:key="L35">そのままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如此时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="02:11.292" end="02:15.752" itunes:key="L51">鮮やかに煌めいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绚烂地闪烁光芒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za ya ka ni ki ra me i te</span></p><p begin="02:24.270" end="02:26.303" itunes:key="L6019">Limit-tention<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">紧张至极了吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Limit- tension</span></p><p begin="02:26.371" end="02:28.183" itunes:key="L6020">2つ数えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数过两声后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ta tsu ka zo e ta</span></p><p begin="02:28.226" end="02:32.189" itunes:key="L6021">君の声と遅れて来た衝動が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的冲动与你的声音一同 姗姗来迟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko e to o ku re te ki ta sho u do u ga</span></p><p begin="02:32.242" end="02:33.114" itunes:key="L6022">今なら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma na ra</span></p><p begin="02:33.253" end="02:34.776" itunes:key="L6023">そう素敵な<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就向着美好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u su te ki na</span></p><p begin="02:34.926" end="02:37.248" itunes:key="L6024">So so素敵な方へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">美好的方向走去吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">So so su te ki na ho u he</span></p><p begin="02:37.356" end="02:40.129" itunes:key="L6025">そう気付けば色付いていく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到这一切后 眼前的视界便会点点染上色彩</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u ki du ke ba i ro du i te i ku</span></p><p begin="02:40.296" end="02:42.623" itunes:key="L6026">急かす街の理想を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越仓促定下的理想后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se ka su ma chi no ri so u wo ko e re ba mo u</span></p><p begin="02:42.762" end="02:44.106" itunes:key="L6027">超えればもう</p><p begin="02:44.156" end="02:46.510" itunes:key="L6028">矛盾だらけの応えは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就不断添附上</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ju n da ra ke no ko ta e ha</span></p><p begin="02:46.686" end="02:48.747" itunes:key="L6029">寄り添いあっていい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽显矛盾的回应就好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ri so i a 't te i i</span></p><p begin="02:48.976" end="02:50.834" itunes:key="L6030">このままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="02:50.977" end="02:52.850" itunes:key="L6031">そのままで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如此时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ma ma de</span></p><p begin="02:52.968" end="02:57.820" itunes:key="L6032">鮮やかに煌めいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绚烂地闪烁光芒吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a za ya ka ni ki ra me i te</span></p></div></body></tt>